you're back at the show!

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:07.367
-Yeah, I'm real excited
to be back.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:09.267
I really love your new look.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:11.501
-I don't have a new look.

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:15.033
-Uh, what about what you've done
to your -- your eyebrows, maybe?

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:17.801
-Maybe I haven't tweezed
in a while, but, I mean,

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:21.000
natural brows
are really hot right now.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.133
-Sure.
-Hey, Jimmy.

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:24.567
Oh, hey, Cara. What's up?
-Oh. Wow.

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:25.834
-Just talkin' brows.

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:28.267
-Oh, how natural brows
are real hot right now?

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:29.400
-So hot right now.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.567
-Jimmy, did you take my brows?

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:34.167
-Sorry, dude.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.167
-Thank you.

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:40.934
